l-2 text-sm text-gray-500\">Comments: 7</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Post 2 -->\n<div class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded-lg card-shadow border border-gray-100 platform-instagram\">\n<div class=\"flex justify-between\">\n<p class=\"font-medium\">@CitySafetyAlerts</p>\n<span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Oct 25, 2023 13:15</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-2\" data-slot=\"s13\">New safety protocol implemented across all districts. Please review updated guidelines posted on our official website. #SafetyProtocol #CityAlert</p>\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center\">\n<span class=\"sentiment-positive px-2 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium\">Positive</span>\n<span class=\"ml-2 text-sm text-gray-500\">Likes: 128</span>\n<span class=\"ml-2 text-sm text-gray-500\">Comments: 23</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Engagement Metrics -->\n<section class=\"mb-8\">\n<h2 class=\"section-header text-xl font-semibold\">Engagement Metrics</h2>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n<div class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded-lg card-shadow border border-gray-100\">\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">Total Likes</p>\n<p class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-1\" data-slot=\"s14\">3,248</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded-lg card-shadow border border-gray-100\">\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">Total Comments</p>\n<p class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-1\" data-slot=\"s15\">847</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded-lg card-shadow border border-gray-100\">\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">Total Shares</p>\n<p class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-1\" data-slot=\"s16\">523</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded-lg card-shadow border border-gray-100\">\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">Total Views</p>\n<p class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-1\" data-slot=\"s17\">12,847</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Trending Topics -->\n<section class=\"mb-8\">\n<h2 class=\"section-header text-xl font-semibold\">Trending Topics</h2>\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">\n<span class=\"bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">#PublicSafety</span>\n<span class=\"bg-green-100 text-green-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">#CommunityWatch</span>\n<span class=\"bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">#CrimePrevention</span>\n<span class=\"bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">#EmergencyAlerts</span>\n<span class=\"bg-red-100 text-red-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">#SafetyProtocol</span>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Intelligence Summary -->\n<section class=\"mb-8\">\n<h2 class=\"section-header text-xl font-semibold\">Intelligence Summary</h2>\n<div class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded-lg card-shadow border border-gray-100\">\n<p class=\"mb-3\" data-slot=\"s18\">The monitoring period has yielded a moderate volume of mentions across social platforms. Most activity stems from community engagement around public safety initiatives. Negative sentiment has slightly increased compared to previous periods, likely due to ongoing discussions about recent incidents.</p>\n<p>Key observations include:</p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1\">\n<li>Increased engagement on safety-related posts</li>\n<li>Emerging discussion threads around neighborhood watch programs</li>\n<li>High visibility of official police accounts during community events</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</section>\n<footer class=\"text-center text-sm text-gray-500 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100\">\n<p data-slot=\"s19\">\u00a9 2023 Police Intelligence Monitoring System | Confidential Report</p>\n</footer>\n</body>", "slots": [{"slot_id": "s1", "slot_type": "stat_number", "sample_text": "1,284", "context_label": "Total Mentions", "chips": [], "meaning_text": "", "maps_to": null, "status": "clean"}, {"slot_id": "s2", "slot_type": "stat_number", "sample_text": "3.2%", "context_label": "Engagement Rate", "chips": [], "meaning_text": "", "maps_to": null, "status": "clean"}, {"slot_id": "s3", "slot_type": "stat_number", "s